# Collected from other companies' own pages, plus the per-host permission survey that gates the
# collection. Kept locally as evidence; this repository is public and is the wrong place for a
# report on anyone else's posture. scripts/brand-catalogue.mjs regenerates all of it.
data/brands/

# Market-map output: a ranked table of which domains an answer engine cites for a given set of
# questions. The prompt sets are committed, because the questions are the method; the results name
# other companies' positions and are analysis, which this repository is the wrong place for.
data/market-map-brand-comparison-*.json

# Full verification-run output: agent prose, record bodies and complete verdicts.
# Kept locally as evidence, never published. scripts/slim-runs.mjs writes the
# redacted summaries that data/runs/*.json carry and that the site is built from.
data/runs/raw/

# Per-record working files for in-flight verification runs.
data/runs/records/
data/runs/feedback/
data/runs/records3/
data/runs/procedures/
# This project's own index coverage, read from the Bing Webmaster API by
# scripts/bing-coverage.mjs. data/DASHBOARD.md is committed rather than published so that
# competitors named in the comparison tables cannot read this project's scoreboard; the same
# reasoning applies with more force to a per-section map of which of our pages an engine has not
# indexed, so this one is not committed at all.
data/coverage/

public/access.json
sources-private/

# The canary ledger proves which published records are ours. Private by definition.
measurement/
public/brand-disclosure.json
